section.center(data-transition="fade", data-state="hide-menubar")
	h1 Simplemenu
	h3 for Reveal.js
	p Flat navigation

section(data-name="Why?")
	h3 Why?

section
	p Sometimes viewers don’t understand the whole concept of vertical navigation for nested slides.
	p A solution would be to limit your presentation to horizontal slides only, but you might still want to use ‘chapters’. 

section
	p Simplemenu has a solution for that. Make your presentation in a flat structure (no nested sections) and turn the #[code flat] option to #[code true]. Then, if a data-name is set for a slide, any following slides will keep that menu name.
	p.small Of course, you can set it to stop inheriting the name as well.

section(data-name="Set it up")
	h3 Set it up

section
	p.small Set the flat option to #[code true]:
	pre
		code.hljs.javascript(data-line-numbers="4").
			&hellip;
			Reveal.initialize({
			    simplemenu: {
			        flat: true
			    },
			    plugins: [ Simplemenu ]

section
	h4 HTML Markup
	p.small Build your presentation in a flat way (no nested slides). #[br]Then give your sections a #[code data-name]:
	pre
		code.hljs.html(data-line-numbers).
			&lt;div class="slides"&gt;
			    &lt;section data-name="Chapter 1"&gt;
			        //...
			    &lt;/section&gt;
			    &lt;section&gt;
			        //... The 'Chapter 1' menu-item will be active for this slide
			    &lt;/section&gt;
			    &lt;section&gt;
			        //... The 'Chapter 1' menu-item will be active for this slide
			    &lt;/section&gt;
			&lt;/div&gt;
section
	p Any slides following a slide with a data-name will keep that menu name.

section.center(data-sm="false")
	p To stop inheriting the previous slide menu name, start a new named section, or add #[code data-sm="false"] to your slide.
	pre
		code.hljs.html(data-line-numbers="8-10").
			&lt;div class="slides"&gt;
			    &lt;section data-name="Chapter 1"&gt;
			        //...
			    &lt;/section&gt;
			    &lt;section&gt;
			        //... The 'Chapter 1' menu-item will be active for this slide
			    &lt;/section&gt;
			    &lt;section data-sm="false"&gt;
			        //... No menu-item will be active for this slide
			    &lt;/section&gt;
			&lt;/div&gt;

section.center(data-state="hide-menubar")
	h2 That’s it!